  "body": "**[Original report](https://bitbucket.org/agriggio/art/issues/109) by Mike (Bitbucket: [Mike](https://bitbucket.org/Mike), GitHub: [Mike](https://github.com/Mike)).**\n\n----------------------------------------\n\nDuring some tests for the film simulation I found on all OS that the 1-star rating is not shown as filled icon.   \nOnly an empty star is shown for images that are rated higher than 1. Rating a image with 1 let ART “flash” briefly and no icon is set.\n\nHere a screenshot from the Windows version:\n\n![](https://bitbucket.org/repo/9pArXyE/images/2788604063-image.png)\nIs this intentionally?   \nWould be a bit irritating, because the 4-star rating could easily interpreted as 3-star.\n",
